# GMS pays 2% of the enemy's defence a Freeze Stack, on frozen enemies only,
# over four levels of a chance that reaches certainty at the top. The chance is
# dropped, as every rolled certainty here is; what is left is GMS's own 2% a
# stack, walked evenly over the twenty levels this book pays for. A full pile
# of five ignores the 10% GMS's does.
name: "Shatter"
skill_order: 4
description:
  "When attacking Frozen enemies, ignores a portion of their defenses for "
  "each stack."
kind: SKILL_KIND_PASSIVE
job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_MAGE
max_level: 20
base { ied_pct_per_freeze_stack: 0.001 }
per_level { ied_pct_per_freeze_stack: 0.001 }
